  "description": "Oil of Every Pearl's Un-Insides is the debut studio album by British electronic music producer Sophie and the only one to be released during her lifetime. It was released on 15 June 2018, through Transgressive, Future Classic and Sophie's own label, MSMSMSM. The title may be a mondegreen of the phrase \"I love every person's insides\". The album was Sophie's second full-length release after the singles collection Product (2015).",
